{"4677280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GUTTED: Infested Crypts", "steam_appid": 4677280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was once a place of rest has become a pulsating hive of insects, flesh, and decay, buried beneath a forest that swallows the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visceral Action-Horror FPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A methodical descent into nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Close-Range Combat </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through infested horrors with weighty weapons, crushing impacts, and brutal dismemberment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oppressive Horror Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suffocating forest and desecrated crypts consumed by infestation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Descent into Suffocating Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore crypts where visibility is scarce, every sound matters, and danger crawls just beyond your flashlight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hear the Horror Before You See It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skittering sounds, distant screeches, and oppressive silence turn every corridor into a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was once a place of rest has become a pulsating hive of insects, flesh, and decay, buried beneath a forest that swallows the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visceral Action-Horror FPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A methodical descent into nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Close-Range Combat </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through infested horrors with weighty weapons, crushing impacts, and brutal dismemberment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oppressive Horror Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"